right horizon. Standard payment terms on your side would also be useful to know.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your feedback.\r\n\r\n\r\nSincères salutations, Yours sincerely,\r\n\r\n\r\nJayson ANGELE\r\n\r\nGouvernance et Management des Technologies de l''Information\r\n\r\n[https://outlook.office.com/mail/id/AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC%2FEWg0AY4fa021F3UygPP3zgEnunAAI17PzcgAA?nativeVersion=1.2026.818.100]<https://www.inovops.com/>\r\n\r\nT:   +33.9.72.50.48.58\r\nM: +33.6.13.82.61.70\r\nE:  jan@inovops.com<mailto:jan@inovops.com>\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nAdopt the eco-attitude | Print this mail only if it is essential.\r\n\r\n[cid:f8e7727b-890c-4691-9929-5cb66158ac0b]<https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/051e949665b94c039fabae96e198155a@inovops.com?anonymous&ismsaljsauthenabled&ep=bwmEmailSignature>\r\nBook time to meet with me<https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/051e949665b94c039fabae96e198155a@inovops.com?anonymous&ismsaljsauthenabled&ep=bwmEmailSignature>\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Dorin Munteanu <dorin@phoenixiq.io>\r\nSent: Thursday, August 27, 2026 22:59\r\nTo: Jayson ANGELE <jan@inovops.com>\r\nSubject: JD SMPM Role\r\n\r\nHi Jayson,\r\n\r\nAs discussed today, please see the JD attached.\r\nThe client we are talking is European Commission.\r\n\r\nRegarding the rate, one last way I could ask the client if there is still left some flexibility, is by submitting the CV and leverage your rare expertise. However, I cannot promise that they will agree, but I’ve had situation where due to a very niche technology request, they managed to get some extra budget.\r\n\r\nHow does this sound to you?\r\nCan you please let me know your thoughts once reviewing the JD and you want to try to introduce you further.\r\n\r\nAppreciate your prompt feedback and looking forward to hear form you.\r\n\r\n--\r\nKind Regards,\r\n\r\nDorin M.\r\n+31683364605\r\nPhoenix IQ\r\n\r\n\r\nSi